<title>JAPAN: Comson says to issue convertible bonds, warrants.</title>
<headline>Comson says to issue convertible bonds, warrants.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Machinery maker Comson Corp said on Wednesday that it would issue $10 million of dollar-denominated convertible bonds on August 19 and $10 million of dollar-denominated warrants on September 17.</p>
</text>
